chain: ES2011
language: en
note: REAL meetings: AMI Meeting Corpus (CC BY 4.0) scenario series ES2011a-d, a role-played design team speaking spontaneously. Turns = AMI manual words merged per speaker (gap <= 2 s), turns under 2 words dropped. Gold = decisions listed in the human DECISIONS abstracts, evidence found through the human summary links; the slot list and allowed values were written by the AI assistant. Meeting dates are assigned (weekly) because AMI has none. Not the product's target domain (corporate board meetings).
now: 2026-03-02T00:00:00Z
people: id=Industrial Designer, me=Marketing Expert, pm=Project Manager, ui=User Interface Designer
object: locator | decision | Locator function | outcome:enum[included,excluded]!reverse
object: speech | decision | Speech recognition | outcome:enum[included,excluded]!reverse
object: stand | decision | Stand for the remote | outcome:enum[included,excluded]!reverse
object: locator_signal | decision | Locator signal | outcome:enum[sound,LED light]
object: buttons | decision | Main navigation control | outcome:enum[scroll wheel,number pad]
object: case_material | decision | Case material | outcome:enum[spongy material,hard plastic]
object: changeable_case | decision | Changeable outer casing | outcome:enum[included,excluded]!reverse
object: shape | decision | Remote shape | outcome:enum[uniform shape,fruit and vegetable shapes]

